Package: domain-probe
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Darcy Luis Neves Bras da Silva <stardevelin@gmail.com>
Description: Fast, thorough domain intelligence from the terminal
 domain-probe runs parallel probes against a URL or hostname and returns
 a structured report covering DNS, TLS, HTTP, security headers, redirects,
 RDAP/WHOIS, technology fingerprinting, and an overall health grade.
